<title>TUNISIA: Dollar climbs to record high vs Tunisian dinar.</title>
<headline>Dollar climbs to record high vs Tunisian dinar.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The dollar on Friday climbed to its highest level against the Tunisian dinar since Tunisias domestic forex market started in March 1994, dealers said.</p>
<p>At midday, the dollar was trading at 1.0747 dinars, against 1.0715 dinars on Thursday on the interbank market.</p>
<p>The rise reflects the dollars surge on the international market, dealers said.</p>
<p>Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
